    },
    {
      "id": "e_healed_lbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 728,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 66,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785979775708,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One ring again \u2014 faulty members were kept in the list (not deleted), tagged\nwith an incarnation number, so gossip reconciles both views into one ring\nautomatically once the network stops lying to it.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "One ring again \u2014 faulty members were kept in the list (not deleted), tagged\nwith an incarnation number, so gossip reconciles both views into one ring\nautomatically once the network stops lying to it.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 566,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785979775708,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The mechanism that causes split-brain (no node has a global view) is the\nsame one that heals it (gossip eventually converges once messages flow\nagain).\n\nRingpop is retired. Cadence \u2014 Uber's own workflow engine \u2014 reused it for\nthe same shard-ownership job, hit rising CPU and an unmaintained TChannel\ndependency, and migrated to Serf: a different gossip library, chosen\nspecifically to keep the same sub-2-second failure detection while\ndropping Ringpop's baggage.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The mechanism that causes split-brain (no node has a global view) is the\nsame one that heals it (gossip eventually converges once messages flow\nagain).\n\nRingpop is retired. Cadence \u2014 Uber's own workflow engine \u2014 reused it for\nthe same shard-ownership job, hit rising CPU and an unmaintained TChannel\ndependency, and migrated to Serf: a different gossip library, chosen\nspecifically to keep the same sub-2-second failure detection while\ndropping Ringpop's baggage.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
    "gridSize": null,
    "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"
